1
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:17,100
The porch light's on and the yard is loud tonight

2
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:23,000
Our girl is laughing hard the way she did at five

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,339
The boy is carrying his daughter way up high

4
00:00:28,339 --> 00:00:33,820
She pulls his ear and points up at the sky

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:38,920
We did it me and you

6
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:45,200
Every long night every worn-out shoe

7
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,579
We did it hand in hand

8
00:00:49,579 --> 00:00:53,539
Not the way we ever planned

9
00:00:53,539 --> 00:00:56,600
But we did it

10
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:01,899
The truck broke down that winter we were twenty-three

11
00:01:01,899 --> 00:01:07,939
You walked home through the rain arms full of groceries

12
00:01:07,939 --> 00:01:12,719
We made one bag of rice last half of January

13
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:19,359
And every night you made it taste like something new

14
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:24,540
We did it me and you

15
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:30,540
Every long night every worn-out shoe

16
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:36,000
We did it hand in hand

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,060
Not the way we ever planned

18
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:41,980
But we did it

19
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:58,200
The house went quiet when the last one packed the car

20
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:03,280
I found your hand across the bed and asked now what

21
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:10,039
You said I guess we learn to sleep past six again

22
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:16,319
And we just lay there smiling in the dark

23
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:21,659
We did it me and you

24
00:02:21,659 --> 00:02:28,340
Every long night every worn-out shoe

25
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:33,159
We did it look at them

26
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:36,259
I would do it all again

27
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:42,599
The yard is getting still

28
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:50,580
The cars pulled down the lane

29
00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:52,360
You lean into my arm the way you always do

